**Topology:** Manual trigger → Get Channel Info (Slack connector) → End

**What it does:**
- Calls Slack's `Get Channel Info` connector activity (`uipath.connector.uipath-salesforce-slack.get-channel-info`) with the channel ID **hardcoded** to `C0B50H7DE2F` — the resolved ID for `#office-bellevue` (found via live lookup against your workspace, page 4 of the channel list)
